# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile bosonic circuits {#transpile-bosonic-circuits}"
msgstr "Transpile litar bosonik {#transpile-bosonic-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide explains how to transpile a [`BosonicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-bosonic-circuit#qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit\") to a standard [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). A bosonic circuit carries no truncation, no encoding, and no qubit count (see [Work with bosonic circuits](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation)), so the transpiler is where those choices are made. The truncation and the encoding are described by a [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") (see [Describe the truncation with a LevelSpec](mappers#level-spec-explanation)), and the mapper that turns operators into qubit operators is described in [Map operator representations](mappers#mappers-explanation). The result is an ordinary [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit), so any Qiskit-compatible simulator can run it.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menerangkan cara transpile [`BosonicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-bosonic-circuit#qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit\") kepada [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) standard. Litar bosonik tidak membawa pemangkasan, pengekodan, mahupun bilangan qubit (lihat [Bekerja dengan litar bosonik](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation)), jadi Transpiler ialah tempat pilihan tersebut dibuat. Pemangkasan dan pengekodan diterangkan oleh [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") (lihat [Menerangkan pemangkasan dengan LevelSpec](mappers#level-spec-explanation)), dan pemeta yang menukar pengendali kepada pengendali qubit diterangkan dalam [Memetakan perwakilan pengendali](mappers#mappers-explanation). Hasilnya ialah [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) biasa, jadi mana-mana simulator yang serasi dengan Qiskit boleh menjalankannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The guide uses one small example throughout: two bosonic modes, a state with one boson in each, and a single time evolution under a Bose-Hubbard Hamiltonian whose bond and on-site terms are in separate groups (see [Group operator terms: use the operator structure](grouping#grouping-explanation)):\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menggunakan satu contoh kecil sepanjang masa: dua mod bosonik, keadaan dengan satu boson dalam setiap satu, dan satu evolusi masa di bawah Hamiltonian Bose-Hubbard yang sebutan ikatan dan dalam-tapaknya berada dalam kumpulan berasingan (lihat [Mengumpulkan sebutan pengendali: gunakan struktur pengendali](grouping#grouping-explanation)):\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpilation stages {#transpilation-stages}"
msgstr "Peringkat transpilasi {#transpilation-stages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As explained in [`qiskit_bosons.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler#module-qiskit_bosons.transpiler \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler\"), the preset pass managers in this package split the transpilation into the following stages:\n"
msgstr "Seperti yang diterangkan dalam [`qiskit_bosons.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler#module-qiskit_bosons.transpiler \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler\"), pengurus laluan pratetap dalam pakej ini membahagikan transpilasi kepada peringkat berikut:\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Input** {#input}"
msgstr "**Masukan** {#input}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts the circuit to a directed acyclic graph (DAG) data structure, the representation that every later pass works on.\n"
msgstr "Menukar litar kepada struktur data graf berarah tanpa kitaran (DAG), perwakilan yang digunakan oleh setiap laluan kemudian.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Optimization** {#optimization}"
msgstr "**Pengoptimuman** {#optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keeps the circuit in bosonic space. These passes use the structure of the bosonic operators, in particular their groups, while no qubit information exists yet. [`B2BSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-b-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis\") is the pass that breaks gates down here, with a plugin for each type of gate: a product formula or qDRIFT for an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\"), and the Clements mesh for a [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") (see [Synthesize an Evolution gate in bosonic space](bosonic-synthesis#bosonic-synthesis-explanation) for how a method is chosen). [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") reorders the modes. The preset decomposes mode rotations in this stage and leaves everything else as it is.\n"
msgstr "Mengekalkan litar dalam ruang bosonik. Laluan ini menggunakan struktur pengendali bosonik, khususnya kumpulannya, sementara belum ada maklumat qubit. [`B2BSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-b-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis\") ialah laluan yang menguraikan gate di sini, dengan pemalam bagi setiap jenis gate: formula hasil darab atau qDRIFT untuk [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\"), dan mesh Clements untuk [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") (lihat [Mensintesis gate Evolution dalam ruang bosonik](bosonic-synthesis#bosonic-synthesis-explanation) untuk cara kaedah dipilih). [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") menyusun semula mod. Pratetap menguraikan putaran mod dalam peringkat ini dan membiarkan yang lain seperti sedia ada.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Layout** {#layout}"
msgstr "**Susun atur** {#layout}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maps each bosonic mode register to a quantum register. A bosonic mode generally occupies several qubits ($d$ of them under the unary encodings, $\\lceil \\log_2 d \\rceil$ under the compact ones), so the quantum register is wider than the mode register. [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") derives the register width from a [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\").\n"
msgstr "Memetakan setiap register mod bosonik kepada register kuantum. Satu mod bosonik lazimnya menduduki beberapa qubit ($d$ qubit di bawah pengekodan unari, $\\lceil \\log_2 d \\rceil$ di bawah pengekodan padat), jadi register kuantum lebih lebar daripada register mod. [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") memperoleh lebar register daripada [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Synthesis** {#synthesis}"
msgstr "**Sintesis** {#synthesis}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts bosonic gates to qubit operations, one plugin per gate type. Encoding happens in this step: the plugin for an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate maps its operator to a qubit operator, and the plugin for an [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") gate sets the qubits that encode each occupation. A barrier is carried onto every qubit of each register it touched.\n"
msgstr "Menukar gate bosonik kepada operasi qubit, satu pemalam bagi setiap jenis gate. Pengekodan berlaku dalam langkah ini: pemalam untuk gate [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") memetakan pengendalinya kepada pengendali qubit, dan pemalam untuk gate [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") menetapkan qubit yang mengekod setiap penghunian. Penghadang dibawa ke atas setiap qubit bagi setiap register yang disentuhnya.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Qubit** {#qubit}"
msgstr "**Qubit** {#qubit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiles the resulting qubit circuit with Qiskit’s own methods, for example to a basis gate set or a device. The preset always includes it; by default it is Qiskit’s preset pass manager, which synthesizes every evolution into gates (see [Continue on the qubit level](#transpilation-qubit-stage)).\n"
msgstr "Transpile litar qubit yang terhasil dengan kaedah Qiskit sendiri, contohnya kepada set gate asas atau peranti. Pratetap sentiasa menyertakannya; secara lalai ia ialah pengurus laluan pratetap Qiskit, yang mensintesis setiap evolusi kepada gate (lihat [Meneruskan pada aras qubit](#transpilation-qubit-stage)).\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Output** {#output}"
msgstr "**Keluaran** {#output}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts the internal DAG data structure back to a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"
msgstr "Menukar struktur data DAG dalaman kembali kepada [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The truncation and the encoding are not stored in the circuit. They are given to the transpiler, and the layout, the state preparation, and the mapper must all agree on them. The preset ensures that by handing the same [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") to all three.\n"
msgstr "Pemangkasan dan pengekodan tidak disimpan dalam litar. Ia diberikan kepada Transpiler, dan susun atur, penyediaan keadaan, dan pemeta mesti bersetuju mengenainya. Pratetap memastikannya dengan menyerahkan [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") yang sama kepada ketiga-tiganya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "A practical example {#a-practical-example}"
msgstr "Contoh praktikal {#a-practical-example}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-occupation-pass-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager\") builds the pipeline from a spec. Lowering the example under two encodings only changes the spec. The preset ends in Qiskit’s own qubit-level transpilation, which would synthesize the evolution into gates. To see the circuit exactly as the bosonic stages emit it, empty that stage first:\n"
msgstr "[`generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-occupation-pass-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager\") membina saluran paip daripada spesifikasi. Menurunkan contoh di bawah dua pengekodan hanya mengubah spesifikasi. Pratetap berakhir dengan transpilasi aras qubit Qiskit sendiri, yang akan mensintesis evolusi kepada gate. Untuk melihat litar tepat seperti yang dihasilkan oleh peringkat bosonik, kosongkan peringkat itu dahulu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The two encodings use six and four qubits respectively (three levels per mode under the unary encoding, two qubits per mode under the Gray code), but the structure of the circuit is the same: two [`XGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate) operations prepare the occupations, and one [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate) carries the evolution.\n"
msgstr "Kedua-dua pengekodan masing-masing menggunakan enam dan empat qubit (tiga aras bagi setiap mod di bawah pengekodan unari, dua qubit bagi setiap mod di bawah kod Gray), tetapi struktur litar adalah sama: dua operasi [`XGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate) menyediakan penghunian, dan satu [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate) membawa evolusi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare with the traditional workflow {#compare-with-the-traditional-workflow}"
msgstr "Bandingkan dengan aliran kerja tradisional {#compare-with-the-traditional-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [bosonic circuits](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation) guide describes the traditional workflow, which maps the Hamiltonian to a qubit operator *before* it builds the [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). The two routes produce equivalent circuits. They differ in what has to be redone when the truncation changes. The bosonic circuit is built once and lowered at every cutoff, whereas the map-first route needs the operator mapped again and the circuit rebuilt:\n"
msgstr "Panduan [litar bosonik](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation) menerangkan aliran kerja tradisional, yang memetakan Hamiltonian kepada pengendali qubit *sebelum* membina [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). Kedua-dua laluan menghasilkan litar yang setara. Perbezaannya ialah apa yang perlu diulang apabila pemangkasan berubah. Litar bosonik dibina sekali dan diturunkan pada setiap had, manakala laluan peta-dahulu memerlukan pengendali dipetakan semula dan litar dibina semula:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The entangling-gate count depends on how Qiskit synthesizes the evolution gate, which changes between releases, so plot it:\n"
msgstr "Bilangan gate berbelit bergantung pada cara Qiskit mensintesis gate evolusi, yang berubah antara keluaran, jadi plotkannya:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![CX count of the lowered circuit against the number of levels d, growing quickly with d.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-bosons/transpilation-4.avif)\n"
msgstr "![CX count of the lowered circuit against the number of levels d, growing quickly with d.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-bosons/transpilation-4.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The count grows quickly with the cutoff, which is the reason to keep the cutoff a parameter of the transpilation and not of the circuit. The two routes are equivalent here, but only the bosonic one can also interleave the grouping of the operator with the product formula (see [Synthesize an Evolution gate in bosonic space](bosonic-synthesis#bosonic-synthesis-explanation)) or hand the encoding to a different spec without changing a line of the circuit.\n"
msgstr "Bilangan meningkat dengan pantas mengikut had, dan itulah sebab untuk menjadikan had sebagai parameter transpilasi dan bukan litar. Kedua-dua laluan adalah setara di sini, tetapi hanya laluan bosonik yang juga boleh menyelang-nyelikan pengumpulan pengendali dengan formula hasil darab (lihat [Mensintesis gate Evolution dalam ruang bosonik](bosonic-synthesis#bosonic-synthesis-explanation)) atau menyerahkan pengekodan kepada spesifikasi berbeza tanpa mengubah satu baris pun litar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A spec with a single cutoff leaves the number of modes open, so one pass manager serves circuits of any width. A spec with one cutoff per mode fixes the width:\n"
msgstr "Spesifikasi dengan satu had membiarkan bilangan mod terbuka, jadi satu pengurus laluan melayani litar dengan sebarang lebar. Spesifikasi dengan satu had bagi setiap mod menetapkan lebar:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the pipeline by hand {#build-the-pipeline-by-hand}"
msgstr "Membina saluran paip secara manual {#build-the-pipeline-by-hand}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preset is a [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager) with one entry per stage. You can assemble the same pipeline from its parts, which is the starting point for every customization below:\n"
msgstr "Pratetap ialah [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager) dengan satu entri bagi setiap peringkat. Anda boleh memasang saluran paip yang sama daripada bahagian-bahagiannya, iaitu titik permulaan bagi setiap penyesuaian di bawah:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The mapper function receives an operator and the width of the register that the layout derived, and returns a [`SparseObservable`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparseObservable). Because it is given the width, passing `num_qubits` on to [`occupation_encoding()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-library-occupation-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding\") makes the mapper check that the spec fits the register, so a mismatch between the layout and the encoding fails with a clear message.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi pemeta menerima operator dan lebar daftar yang diperoleh daripada reka letak, lalu mengembalikan [`SparseObservable`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparseObservable). Oleh sebab lebar diberikan, menghantar `num_qubits` kepada [`occupation_encoding()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-library-occupation-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding\") menjadikan pemeta menyemak bahawa spesifikasi muat dalam daftar, supaya ketidakpadanan antara reka letak dan pengekodan gagal dengan mesej yang jelas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced workflows {#advanced-workflows}"
msgstr "Aliran kerja lanjutan {#advanced-workflows}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Provide an explicit layout {#provide-an-explicit-layout}"
msgstr "Sediakan reka letak yang eksplisit {#provide-an-explicit-layout}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`CustomB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-custom-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.CustomB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.CustomB2QLayout\") replaces the layout stage with a mapping that you provide, from each bosonic register of the circuit to a quantum register. It is useful when the register must be wider than the spec needs, for example to leave idle qubits for other purposes:\n"
msgstr "[`CustomB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-custom-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.CustomB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.CustomB2QLayout\") menggantikan peringkat reka letak dengan pemetaan yang anda sediakan, daripada setiap daftar boson bagi litar kepada daftar kuantum. Ia berguna apabila daftar mesti lebih lebar daripada yang diperlukan oleh spesifikasi, contohnya untuk membiarkan qubit melahu bagi tujuan lain:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Warning\" type=\"caution\">\n"
"  A custom layout is your responsibility. The synthesis plugins still address qubits through the spec, so a register that does not match the spec’s widths gives a wrong circuit or an error deep inside a plugin. A custom layout also skips the check that [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") performs after [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") (see the next section).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Amaran\" type=\"caution\">\n"
"  Reka letak tersuai ialah tanggungjawab anda. Pemalam sintesis masih menuju qubit melalui spesifikasi, jadi daftar yang tidak sepadan dengan lebar spesifikasi menghasilkan litar yang salah atau ralat jauh di dalam pemalam. Reka letak tersuai juga melangkau semakan yang dilakukan oleh [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") selepas [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") (lihat bahagian seterusnya).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reorder the modes {#reorder-the-modes}"
msgstr "Susun semula mod {#reorder-the-modes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") is an optimization-stage pass that reorders the modes. The permutation is read as a mapping from original to new mode index, and it is recorded in the circuit metadata. The reordering changes which qubits each mode occupies, and so it can reduce the depth of the lowered circuit.\n"
msgstr "[`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") ialah pas peringkat pengoptimuman yang menyusun semula mod. Pilih atur dibaca sebagai pemetaan daripada indeks mod asal kepada indeks mod baharu, dan ia direkodkan dalam metadata litar. Penyusunan semula mengubah qubit yang diduduki oleh setiap mod, dan oleh itu ia boleh mengurangkan kedalaman litar yang diturunkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because the result is expressed in the new mode order, measured bitstrings must be mapped back before they are interpreted. With several qubits per mode, the mapping acts on blocks of qubits and not on single bits. The following example relabels three modes, each occupying two qubits under the Gray code, and recovers the original occupation from the measured counts:\n"
msgstr "Oleh sebab hasilnya dinyatakan dalam susunan mod baharu, rentetan bit yang diukur mesti dipetakan semula sebelum ditafsirkan. Dengan beberapa qubit bagi setiap mod, pemetaan bertindak pada blok qubit dan bukan pada bit tunggal. Contoh berikut melabel semula tiga mod, setiap satu menduduki dua qubit di bawah kod Gray, dan memulihkan penghunian asal daripada kiraan yang diukur:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The restored bitstring is what the circuit produces without the relabeling, read in Qiskit’s little-endian order: mode 0 holds the Gray code of level two (`11`), mode 1 holds level zero (`00`), and mode 2 holds level one (`01`).\n"
msgstr "Rentetan bit yang dipulihkan ialah apa yang dihasilkan oleh litar tanpa pelabelan semula, dibaca dalam susunan little-endian Qiskit: mod 0 memegang kod Gray bagi aras dua (`11`), mod 1 memegang aras sifar (`00`), dan mod 2 memegang aras satu (`01`).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Warning\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Amaran\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  A spec that gives the modes **different** cutoffs cannot be combined with [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\"). The cutoffs are attached to the modes by their position, so reordering the modes would put a cutoff on the wrong mode. [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") refuses a relabeled circuit in that case:\n"
msgstr "  Spesifikasi yang memberikan mod potongan **berbeza** tidak boleh digabungkan dengan [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\"). Potongan dilampirkan pada mod mengikut kedudukannya, jadi menyusun semula mod akan meletakkan potongan pada mod yang salah. [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") menolak litar yang dilabel semula dalam kes itu:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the synthesis plugins {#choose-the-synthesis-plugins}"
msgstr "Pilih pemalam sintesis {#choose-the-synthesis-plugins}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\") has no default plugins; the preset registers one per gate type. The available plugins are managed by [`B2QSynthesisPluginManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-synthesis-b-2-q-synthesis-plugin-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.synthesis.B2QSynthesisPluginManager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.synthesis.B2QSynthesisPluginManager\"), which lists them by the name of the gate they act on:\n"
msgstr "[`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\") tidak mempunyai pemalam lalai; pratetap mendaftarkan satu bagi setiap jenis gate. Pemalam yang tersedia diurus oleh [`B2QSynthesisPluginManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-synthesis-b-2-q-synthesis-plugin-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.synthesis.B2QSynthesisPluginManager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.synthesis.B2QSynthesisPluginManager\"), yang menyenaraikannya mengikut nama gate yang menjadi sasaran tindakannya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The two builtin methods are `Evolution.MapperFn` and `InitializeModes.Occupation`. The first synthesizes an evolution from any mapper function, which is how a custom encoding is plugged in (see [Map operator representations](mappers#mappers-explanation)). The library ships no plugin for a [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") gate. The preset breaks it down in bosonic space into [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") gates first, which the first method then handles, but a plugin registered for `ModeRotation` can lower the gate directly instead; see [Rotate bosonic modes](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-explanation) and [Lower a rotation without decomposing it](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-direct-explanation). You can register a method by name through the `config` argument of [`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\"), or write a plugin object into [`B2QSynthesis.methods`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis.methods \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis.methods\") directly, as the preceding examples do.\n"
msgstr "Dua kaedah terbina dalam ialah `Evolution.MapperFn` dan `InitializeModes.Occupation`. Yang pertama mensintesis evolusi daripada mana-mana fungsi pemeta, iaitu cara pengekodan tersuai dipasang (lihat [Map operator representations](mappers#mappers-explanation)). Pustaka ini tidak menyediakan pemalam untuk gate [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\"). Pratetap memecahkannya dalam ruang boson kepada gate [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") terlebih dahulu, yang kemudian dikendalikan oleh kaedah pertama, tetapi pemalam yang didaftarkan untuk `ModeRotation` boleh menurunkan gate itu secara langsung; lihat [Rotate bosonic modes](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-explanation) dan [Lower a rotation without decomposing it](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-direct-explanation). Anda boleh mendaftarkan kaedah mengikut nama melalui argumen `config` bagi [`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\"), atau menulis objek pemalam terus ke dalam [`B2QSynthesis.methods`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis.methods \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis.methods\"), seperti contoh sebelum ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"transpilation-qubit-stage\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Continue on the qubit level {#continue-on-the-qubit-level}"
msgstr "Teruskan pada peringkat qubit {#continue-on-the-qubit-level}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preset always ends in a `qubit` stage, which is Qiskit’s own preset pass manager. Keyword arguments of [`generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-occupation-pass-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager\") are handed to [`qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager), so you can translate to a basis gate set or target a device directly. Prefer `optimization_level=0` to keep the circuit close to what the bosonic stages produced:\n"
msgstr "Pratetap sentiasa berakhir dengan peringkat `qubit`, iaitu pengurus pas pratetap milik Qiskit sendiri. Argumen kata kunci bagi [`generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-occupation-pass-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager\") dihantar kepada [`qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager), jadi anda boleh menterjemah kepada set gate asas atau menyasarkan peranti secara langsung. Utamakan `optimization_level=0` untuk mengekalkan litar hampir dengan apa yang dihasilkan oleh peringkat boson:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two other choices are common. Assign an empty [`PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) to the `qubit` stage when you want to show the circuit exactly as the pipeline synthesized it, as the examples above do. Or assemble the pipeline yourself and add any Qiskit pass manager as the `qubit` stage of the [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager). Stages run in the order they are given, so the `qubit` stage must come before `output`, because Qiskit’s passes expect a DAG and not a finished circuit:\n"
msgstr "Dua pilihan lain yang lazim. Tetapkan [`PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) kosong kepada peringkat `qubit` apabila anda mahu menunjukkan litar tepat seperti yang disintesis oleh saluran paip, seperti contoh di atas. Atau pasang saluran paip sendiri dan tambahkan mana-mana pengurus pas Qiskit sebagai peringkat `qubit` bagi [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager). Peringkat dijalankan mengikut susunan yang diberikan, jadi peringkat `qubit` mesti datang sebelum `output`, kerana pas Qiskit menjangkakan DAG dan bukan litar yang telah siap:\n"

